            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\n\nI don't think treating every selection type the same is a good idea. Mostly because treating them differently aligns with most of built-in behavior. And also selecting linewise is not significantly less convenient than charwise or blockwise.\n\nClosing as not planned.",
