        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I understand, I'm not asking for a new default behaviour, usually other move plugins like move.nvim provide a function like MoveLineWise(-1), which also works with visual mode, so we can decide the behaviour we want. mini.move provides the MiniMove.move_line('down'), but that doesn't work with visual mode.  ",
